{"articleNo":"66489","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=66489&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012-2학기 국가장학금(Ⅰ,Ⅱ유형) 및 교내 스마일장학금 지급 안내(2차)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.27","hit":"8720","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012-2학기 한국장학재단 국가장학금(Ⅰ,Ⅱ유형) 및 교내 스마일장학금 지급 안내(2차)</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 2차 장학생 선발 및 장학금 지급은 10월말&nbsp;발표 예정</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">[단, 한국장학재단의 소득심사 결과통보 일정에 따라 장학생 선발 및 장학금 지급 일정이 변경될수도 있음]</span></font></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 한국장학재단 홈페이지 장학현황에 신청된 장학금 승인결과 확인</span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -22.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가장학금Ⅰ,Ⅱ유형 선발자는 한국장학재단사이트에 “선발완료”로 표기</span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -22.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가장학금Ⅰ유형은 \"선발완료\"이나 </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">국가장학금Ⅱ유형이 “선발탈락”으로 표기되어 있는 학생 중 성적(평점평균 2.6)이 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">충족되는 경우 교내 스마일장학금으로 지급</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 국가장학금 및 교내 스마일장학금 지급액은 소득분위별(1분위~7분위)로 차등지급</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 국가장학금Ⅰ유형.국가장학금Ⅱ유형.스마일장학금을 합한 </font></span></span></span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">총액</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">으로 확인</span></font></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒국가장학금 및 교내스마일장학금 지급유형(소득1~7분위) </span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가Ⅰ만 지급</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가Ⅱ만 지급</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 스마일만 지급</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가Ⅰ과 국가Ⅱ 동시 지급</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가Ⅰ과 스마일 동시 지급</span></span></span></p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">금오공대 학생처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
